WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Downloaded @ subs4free.club


00:02:24.990 --> 00:02:27.170
Yang He, you're leaving now?


00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.750
Mr. Film needs this quickly.


00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.500
Otherwise who would go this late?


00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.580
Let's have a quick drink.


00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:10.750
Which Yang?


00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:13.390
From the collective farm.
Who else could it be?


00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.520
Supervisor Yang is your elder brother?


00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:18.820
Yes.


00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.090
Is the screening finished?


00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:08.110
Did it include the Newsreel?


00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.570
What?


00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.480
The Newsreel.


00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:15.340
Go and see for yourself.
-Where can I see it?


00:04:15.390 --> 00:04:18.350
Tomorrow, the 2nd Unit will show it.
-How do I get there?


00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:20.970
Head east.


00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:52.100
"Heroic Sons and Daughters"-Reel 6


00:08:12.870 --> 00:08:15.640
If I had known you were a girl,
I wouldn't have hit you.


00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.600
Why did you steal this?
To sell it?


00:08:19.400 --> 00:08:20.770
None of your damn business.


00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.350
Who are you?


00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.190
Get lost.


00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.820
Let's take half each.


00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.430
What kind of girl are you?


00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:56.050
Running around at night,
carrying a knife.


00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.920
Give my knife back.


00:09:00.160 --> 00:09:01.520
Where do you live?


00:09:05.460 --> 00:09:06.820
Hey, seriously.


00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.840
Half each.
All right?


00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.230
Or just give me 12.5 meters?


00:09:15.940 --> 00:09:17.510
12.5 meters, what for?


00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.680
Nothing.
Just give it to me.


00:12:28.500 --> 00:12:30.000
You're from the 2nd Unit?


00:12:31.740 --> 00:12:32.740
Yes.


00:12:34.130 --> 00:12:35.560
I'm from the 4th Unit.


00:12:38.700 --> 00:12:40.530
Why are you by yourself?


00:12:43.310 --> 00:12:45.800
I'm looking for someone.
-Who are you looking for?


00:12:47.660 --> 00:12:49.630
I tell you,
in this place


00:12:50.760 --> 00:12:52.440
you shouldn't just wander around.


00:12:53.460 --> 00:12:55.160
It's an empty desert.


00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:57.460
If I hadn't picked you up


00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:00.340
you'd have died of thirst.


00:13:18.900 --> 00:13:21.560
Pick that person up.
-No. Not enough room.


00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:23.870
She's the one I'm looking for!
-Who is she?


00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:26.890
My daughter.
She ran away three days ago.


00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:28.940
Come on, stop the truck! Stop!


00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.750
All right. All right.
Just get in!


00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:51.300
You think you can run?


00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:54.330
This child!
Terrible.


00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:19.450
Did you steal something and run away?


00:14:21.060 --> 00:14:23.360
How can you be
so out of control?


00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:25.960
Your father has chased you for days!


00:14:26.520 --> 00:14:27.530
What father?


00:14:27.580 --> 00:14:29.160
Isn't that your father?


00:14:31.430 --> 00:14:33.360
Him?
My father died ages ago.


00:14:33.570 --> 00:14:36.520
I should slap you.
You dare to speak like that?


00:14:36.780 --> 00:14:39.540
He's been worried sick about you.
Right?


00:14:39.590 --> 00:14:41.100
You're lucky you ran into me.


00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:44.170
What if he died of thirst?
You'd have no home to cry in.


00:14:46.660 --> 00:14:49.850
Girl, I don't know
your family business,


00:14:50.350 --> 00:14:51.860
but no matter how far you run,


00:14:52.090 --> 00:14:53.360
he's still your father.


00:14:53.490 --> 00:14:55.440
You only have one set of parents.


00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:56.570
Right?


00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.040
Don't do something you'll regret.


00:15:04.340 --> 00:15:05.490
All right?


00:15:05.660 --> 00:15:07.030
You two are in my truck,


00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:08.580
so you have to listen to me.


00:15:09.630 --> 00:15:10.870
Say sorry to him.


00:15:14.830 --> 00:15:16.680
Fine!
Sorry is sorry.


00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:19.760
He is my father.


00:15:20.260 --> 00:15:23.070
You know what kind of man he is?
-What kind of man is he?


00:15:23.460 --> 00:15:25.020
He has a mistress.


00:15:25.300 --> 00:15:27.140
Our family doesn't have enough to eat,


00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.130
but he took a whole year's harvest


00:15:29.380 --> 00:15:31.230
and gave it to his mistress.


00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.760
My mother tried to stop him.


00:15:33.810 --> 00:15:36.250
He argued with her,
threatened to divorce.


00:15:38.550 --> 00:15:40.080
My mother got ill.


00:15:41.430 --> 00:15:42.890
She couldn't afford medicine.


00:15:43.760 --> 00:15:45.700
so now it's just me
and my little brother.


00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.690
Mother died.


00:15:52.140 --> 00:15:53.610
My brother is still young,


00:15:53.660 --> 00:15:55.090
I don't have a job.


00:15:55.260 --> 00:15:57.930
We can't go on like this,
so we went to look for him.


00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.080
He wouldn't open his door.


00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:03.590
We knocked on the door
for ages.


00:16:03.740 --> 00:16:06.310
Finally his mistress came out fighting,


00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.320
beating me and my little brother.


00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.200
Enough.


00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:12.840
That's just like my father.


00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.490
Are you human? Totally heartless!
Worse than a dog!


00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:24.950
Actually, I'm not her father.
-Now, you deny it?


00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:28.020
He chased me all this way
just to take my can.


00:16:28.420 --> 00:16:31.330
Inside is the money and
food stamps my mother left me.


00:16:31.380 --> 00:16:33.180
He even wants to take that.


00:16:36.280 --> 00:16:37.910
Give her the can!


00:16:40.830 --> 00:16:42.630
You hand her the can. Now!


00:16:42.810 --> 00:16:43.810
Damn thug.


00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:45.120
You believe her?


00:16:47.080 --> 00:16:48.290
Stop!


00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.810
Quick, stop the truck!


00:16:52.290 --> 00:16:53.480
Telling me to stop?


00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:55.060
Get lost!


00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:00.690
Let's go!


00:17:17.930 --> 00:17:19.440
Little bitch!


00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:31.420
Stop!
-Can't stop. It'll break again!


00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:39.330
Stop that truck!


00:17:39.870 --> 00:17:41.610
It has the film.


00:17:42.090 --> 00:17:43.380
Stop it!


00:17:43.670 --> 00:17:45.270
The film reel.


00:17:45.710 --> 00:17:47.260
Stop that truck!


00:17:53.050 --> 00:17:55.390
You idiot!


00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:28.190
8pm tonight, national film:
"HEROIC SONS AND DAUGHTERS"


00:18:48.240 --> 00:18:49.650
Mr. Film,


00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:51.100
What time is the screening?


00:18:51.450 --> 00:18:53.270
The film hasn't arrived yet.
Calm down.


00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.600
Have some peanuts.
-All right, all right.


00:18:55.710 --> 00:18:57.110
Take some sunflower seeds.


00:18:57.160 --> 00:18:58.600
When does the film arrive?


00:18:58.650 --> 00:19:01.590
That depends on whether
Yang He screws up or not.


00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.570
Isn't it "Fighting North and South"?


00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.690
Why did you change to
"Heroic Sons and Daughters"?


00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.460
"Heroic Sons and Daughters" is better.


00:19:07.490 --> 00:19:08.510
Definitely.


00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:10.490
Yes,
"Heroic Sons and Daughters" is better.


00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:12.610
We like "Heroic Sons and Daughters".


00:19:12.980 --> 00:19:15.150
What's so great
about "Fighting North and South"?


00:19:15.580 --> 00:19:17.150
Hello, Mr. Fan.


00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.100
Mr. Film, time for noodles?
-Mm.


00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.350
Mr. Film is here.
Come, sit.


00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.170
Mr. Fan.


00:19:29.380 --> 00:19:31.440
Mr. Film is here.


00:19:33.120 --> 00:19:36.020
Mr. Film, you sit here.
I'll sit over there.


00:20:03.660 --> 00:20:05.280
Here are your noodles.


00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:40.920
Your "father" is eating your noodles.


00:20:41.140 --> 00:20:42.600
Is it hard to bear?


00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.240
Sit.


00:21:06.630 --> 00:21:08.840
Reporting...
Comrade projectionist.


00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:12.240
The film reel.


00:21:24.360 --> 00:21:25.600
What reel?


00:21:33.290 --> 00:21:35.380
"Heroic Sons and Daughters", Reel 6.


00:22:06.730 --> 00:22:08.650
It really is
"Heroic Sons and Daughters".


00:22:20.200 --> 00:22:21.710
Where did you get this?


00:22:24.670 --> 00:22:26.370
I'm just returning it, that's all.


00:22:27.380 --> 00:22:28.680
Get back here!


00:22:35.720 --> 00:22:36.820
Have a seat.


00:22:39.860 --> 00:22:41.090
Sit down!


00:22:51.900 --> 00:22:53.310
I know you.


00:22:53.630 --> 00:22:56.200
Aren't you Orphan Liu from our 2nd Unit?


00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:01.550
Comrade, you're not
from our 2nd Unit, are you?


00:23:04.290 --> 00:23:05.670
I'm from the 1st Unit.


00:23:06.480 --> 00:23:07.930
The 1st Unit?


00:23:08.890 --> 00:23:10.750
Then how do you two know each other?


00:23:11.690 --> 00:23:13.790
And how did the reel
end up in your hands?


00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:19.560
Am I wrong to return the reel to you?


00:23:22.400 --> 00:23:24.040
Of course not.


00:23:24.490 --> 00:23:28.240
But... good comrades should
explain good deeds, eh?


00:23:29.760 --> 00:23:31.020
Waiter.
-Yes?


00:23:31.070 --> 00:23:32.960
Two more bowls of noodles.
-All right.


00:23:33.010 --> 00:23:34.280
It's on me.


00:23:34.870 --> 00:23:36.400
And bring my stuff over.


00:23:36.550 --> 00:23:37.870
All right. Coming.


00:23:40.830 --> 00:23:42.580
Your noodles.
-Mm.


00:23:45.150 --> 00:23:47.220
I put extra hot peppers in the noodles.


00:23:48.370 --> 00:23:50.680
Mr. Film, please get me
a good seat at the screening.


00:23:50.730 --> 00:23:52.400
Consider it done.
-Thank you!


00:24:01.430 --> 00:24:04.360
Do you know why I get extra hot peppers?


00:24:06.550 --> 00:24:10.640
It's because I'm highly respected
by everyone in the 2nd Unit.


00:24:13.290 --> 00:24:15.850
Do you know why
everyone calls me Mr. Film?


00:24:17.490 --> 00:24:19.890
It's because I've been
screening films my whole life,


00:24:20.010 --> 00:24:22.120
and I've never made a mistake.


00:24:24.190 --> 00:24:28.010
Screening films in a place like this
is serious business.


00:24:29.110 --> 00:24:33.440
It's a tough crowd out there.
They've been waiting for 2 months.


00:24:33.590 --> 00:24:36.020
Each time
it's like a New Year celebration.


00:24:37.430 --> 00:24:40.520
So I can say,
film reels are treasures to us.


00:24:41.740 --> 00:24:44.470
However many come in,
the same number must be returned.


00:24:44.860 --> 00:24:47.500
We check the count several times.


00:24:47.620 --> 00:24:49.550
This is called...
taking responsibility.


00:24:49.850 --> 00:24:51.650
FILM PROJECTIONIST 001


00:24:54.540 --> 00:24:56.800
How did this reel get separated
from the others?


00:24:59.350 --> 00:25:01.450
How are you two connected to Yang He?


00:25:04.190 --> 00:25:05.680
The fellow on the motorcycle?


00:25:05.870 --> 00:25:07.280
That's right, that's right.


00:25:07.630 --> 00:25:09.890
He transports the reels.
His name is Yang He.


00:25:12.890 --> 00:25:15.200
How did this reel end up in your hands?


00:25:19.130 --> 00:25:20.810
We picked it up on the road.


00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:23.320
Which road?


00:25:23.930 --> 00:25:25.890
The road from the 1st Unit.


00:25:29.410 --> 00:25:31.910
This must have been poorly secured,
so it fell off the bike.


00:25:33.200 --> 00:25:35.960
And Yang He wants to be a projectionist?


00:25:36.010 --> 00:25:37.490
If he were the projectionist


00:25:37.540 --> 00:25:40.110
it would be a nightmare
for everyone in the 2nd Unit.


00:25:42.890 --> 00:25:45.560
Was this the only reel on the road?
-Yes. Just this one.


00:25:46.680 --> 00:25:48.380
Comrade, what's your name?


00:25:50.940 --> 00:25:53.270
What do you do in the 1st Unit?


00:25:56.130 --> 00:25:58.190
She could have brought it back alone.


00:25:58.300 --> 00:26:00.360
Why are you here?


00:26:02.730 --> 00:26:05.000
He's a bad element.
A vandal.


00:26:07.650 --> 00:26:08.670
Who?


00:26:09.000 --> 00:26:10.110
You


00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:12.170
I'm what?


00:26:12.500 --> 00:26:14.360
I said you're a bad element. A vandal


00:26:14.600 --> 00:26:16.490
What makes you think
I'm a bad element?


00:26:16.540 --> 00:26:17.570
You're a vandal.


00:26:17.620 --> 00:26:19.480
Why don't you tell him
about your business?


00:26:19.530 --> 00:26:20.720
You're just a vandal.


00:26:20.770 --> 00:26:22.400
What did I -
-That's enough.


00:26:25.180 --> 00:26:27.180
I knew from the start you're bad.


00:26:27.390 --> 00:26:30.260
Go. Alert the Security Division.
-Yes! Get the Security Division.


00:26:31.740 --> 00:26:34.760
What are you up to?
-Why are you alerting Security?


00:26:34.810 --> 00:26:37.110
Why did you come here?
-I came to watch the film.


00:26:37.980 --> 00:26:40.350
My daughter is in the film.
I came to watch my daughter.


00:26:40.400 --> 00:26:42.410
Your daughter is in
"Heroic Sons and Daughters"?


00:26:42.460 --> 00:26:45.180
Your daughter plays Wang Fang,
the main character in the film?


00:26:45.230 --> 00:26:47.880
Who do you think you're fooling?
Let's get Security.


00:26:48.890 --> 00:26:50.910
Before the film
you play a Newsreel.


00:26:50.960 --> 00:26:52.760
My daughter is in the Newsreel.


00:26:53.480 --> 00:26:54.840
Wait a minute.


00:26:54.990 --> 00:26:56.710
The Newsreel reports national news,


00:26:56.760 --> 00:26:58.750
the great advancement
of Mao Zedong thought.


00:26:58.800 --> 00:27:01.220
We must study the Newsreel.
Should we study your daughter?


00:27:01.380 --> 00:27:04.010
Her school teaches labour and farming,
to serve the people.


00:27:04.100 --> 00:27:06.260
Someone saw the Newsreel
and wrote me a letter.


00:27:06.420 --> 00:27:07.900
What letter?


00:27:21.800 --> 00:27:23.520
Your daughter is a student.
-Yes.


00:27:23.570 --> 00:27:25.980
Mr. Film, Mr. Film! Big problem!
We can't watch the film!


00:27:26.030 --> 00:27:27.750
Ah? What happened?


00:27:29.300 --> 00:27:31.360
We can't screen the film.
-What?


00:27:41.350 --> 00:27:42.980
What's going on?


00:27:43.030 --> 00:27:45.020
Mr. Film is here!


00:27:46.690 --> 00:27:47.810
Problem.


00:27:48.110 --> 00:27:49.400
Big problem!


00:27:50.460 --> 00:27:51.770
Yang He!


00:27:52.330 --> 00:27:53.490
Where's Yang He?


00:27:57.030 --> 00:27:58.560
Where the hell is he?


00:28:00.510 --> 00:28:01.800
Say something!


00:28:02.450 --> 00:28:03.690
Dad...


00:28:04.160 --> 00:28:05.240
It was me.


00:28:05.290 --> 00:28:06.430
Dad...


00:28:07.050 --> 00:28:08.890
You drove the cart?
-Yes.


00:28:08.950 --> 00:28:11.200
Why are Yang He's reels on your cart?


00:28:11.980 --> 00:28:15.130
His motorcycle broke again. He
was worried it couldn't be repaired.


00:28:15.220 --> 00:28:17.480
He insisted I bring the reels to you.


00:28:17.660 --> 00:28:19.630
And this is how you did it?


00:28:19.950 --> 00:28:23.700
You think you're pulling a donkey?
It's all twisted, like intestines.


00:28:24.670 --> 00:28:26.700
I don't have
eyes in the back of my head.


00:28:26.980 --> 00:28:29.180
Who knew this stuff could roll out?


00:28:45.420 --> 00:28:46.870
Where's the sticky tape?


00:28:48.410 --> 00:28:50.280
The tape sealing the can?


00:28:50.410 --> 00:28:53.080
I wrapped it around my whip.
-Why the hell did you do that?


00:28:53.130 --> 00:28:54.760
My whip was falling apart.


00:28:55.910 --> 00:28:57.680
You're afraid the whip will fall apart,


00:28:57.730 --> 00:28:59.870
but you're not afraid
the reels will get damaged?


00:28:59.920 --> 00:29:02.300
What are we supposed to watch then?


00:29:02.350 --> 00:29:03.810
You idiot!


00:29:05.220 --> 00:29:06.950
Isn't that a reel in your hand?


00:29:07.060 --> 00:29:08.640
Use that one. Problem solved.


00:29:08.690 --> 00:29:10.410
What the hell are you talking about?


00:29:10.460 --> 00:29:11.700
This is a drama.


00:29:11.880 --> 00:29:13.300
That's the Newsreel.


00:29:13.350 --> 00:29:14.700
They're totally different.


00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:16.580
You think men and women are the same?


00:29:16.630 --> 00:29:18.240
You really have shit for brains.


00:29:19.380 --> 00:29:20.850
Number 22.


00:29:21.590 --> 00:29:23.630
The letter said Newsreel No. 22.


00:29:24.070 --> 00:29:26.120
Now it's all twisted up.


00:29:26.260 --> 00:29:28.090
It doesn't matter who is in No. 22.


00:29:31.610 --> 00:29:34.230
Comrades...
no screening today.


00:29:35.550 --> 00:29:38.370
We can't watch the Newsreel.
But surely we can still watch the film?


00:29:38.420 --> 00:29:39.430
That's right.


00:29:39.480 --> 00:29:42.140
With such a big problem,
how could we screen the film?


00:29:43.360 --> 00:29:44.720
Everyone can see.


00:29:44.880 --> 00:29:46.350
No film today.


00:29:46.450 --> 00:29:48.070
But it's not our fault.


00:29:51.230 --> 00:29:52.490
You can screen it.


00:29:52.840 --> 00:29:53.980
There is a way.


00:29:54.150 --> 00:29:55.350
How?


00:29:55.400 --> 00:29:58.260
Don't you have some special liquid
that can clean this?


00:29:58.310 --> 00:30:00.070
You mean cleaning fluid?
-Yes.


00:30:00.150 --> 00:30:01.450
I don't!


00:30:02.520 --> 00:30:05.150
Besides... it's way too dirty!


00:30:05.200 --> 00:30:06.580
How can I clean it?


00:30:06.730 --> 00:30:08.100
You tell me!


00:30:09.620 --> 00:30:10.970
Do you understand?


00:30:11.700 --> 00:30:13.590
Know-all!


00:30:20.090 --> 00:30:21.440
But of course...


00:30:22.320 --> 00:30:24.490
We could make one last attempt


00:30:25.070 --> 00:30:26.790
and try to rescue it.


00:30:26.840 --> 00:30:28.610
Do you all want to watch the film?


00:30:28.660 --> 00:30:30.360
Yes!


00:30:30.410 --> 00:30:32.130
All right.


00:30:32.180 --> 00:30:33.770
If you want to watch the film


00:30:34.150 --> 00:30:36.730
please come forward
and be the witnesses


00:30:37.250 --> 00:30:38.820
that todays big accident


00:30:38.930 --> 00:30:40.760
is completely Yang He's fault.


00:30:40.840 --> 00:30:44.130
Right. It is.


00:30:44.420 --> 00:30:45.510
What's more,


00:30:46.260 --> 00:30:47.590
I have two requirements.


00:30:47.690 --> 00:30:49.820
If we succeed,
we can watch the film.


00:30:49.940 --> 00:30:51.790
If we fail,
no film!


00:30:51.950 --> 00:30:54.250
We can do it.


00:30:55.500 --> 00:30:56.560
Firstly,


00:30:57.080 --> 00:30:58.890
we all have to keep quiet about this.


00:30:58.940 --> 00:31:00.670
This incident cannot get out.


00:31:01.000 --> 00:31:03.750
Otherwise, our 2nd Unit
will never screen films again.


00:31:04.120 --> 00:31:05.390
We will all suffer.


00:31:07.230 --> 00:31:08.270
Secondly,


00:31:08.400 --> 00:31:10.410
superiors will deal with Yang He.


00:31:11.060 --> 00:31:13.060
I will deal with the reel.


00:31:13.860 --> 00:31:15.790
Female comrades,
go and fetch


00:31:15.950 --> 00:31:17.720
bed sheets, masks, and gauze


00:31:17.830 --> 00:31:19.560
steamers, chopsticks, and basins.


00:31:19.840 --> 00:31:21.320
Male comrades,
go and fetch


00:31:21.370 --> 00:31:23.560
metal wire, size 12.
Make sure it's clean.


00:31:23.820 --> 00:31:24.980
Everybody agreed?


00:31:25.050 --> 00:31:26.360
All right!


00:31:26.490 --> 00:31:29.010
Get me these things right away.


00:31:29.270 --> 00:31:30.970
Action!


00:31:33.340 --> 00:31:34.470
Get out of here.


00:31:37.010 --> 00:31:39.910
Walk around!
If you step on the film, I'll kill you!


00:32:00.930 --> 00:32:02.240
Put the film down.


00:32:02.290 --> 00:32:03.670
I picked this up off the ground.


00:32:03.720 --> 00:32:05.390
That's the bit with my daughter in it.


00:32:05.440 --> 00:32:07.990
It's not!
-It might be. Just put it down!


00:34:01.550 --> 00:34:02.850
Show yourself!


00:34:04.780 --> 00:34:06.560
Give me the film.


00:34:07.130 --> 00:34:10.160
Give me the film of my daughter.


00:34:10.650 --> 00:34:12.390
Come out!


00:34:46.040 --> 00:34:47.800
This doesn't have your daughter.


00:34:59.530 --> 00:35:00.660
Not there, right?


00:35:00.780 --> 00:35:01.800
It's all white.


00:35:01.870 --> 00:35:03.270
It's just the beginning.


00:35:08.560 --> 00:35:10.040
You take it. I don't want it.


00:35:10.660 --> 00:35:12.040
It doesn't look good.


00:35:12.570 --> 00:35:14.470
What do you want the film for anyway?


00:35:15.080 --> 00:35:16.870
What does it matter what it looks like?


00:35:18.550 --> 00:35:19.940
To make a lampshade.


00:35:20.150 --> 00:35:21.250
A lampshade?


00:35:24.980 --> 00:35:27.110
My little brother is a good student.


00:35:27.920 --> 00:35:29.260
He loves to read.


00:35:30.130 --> 00:35:31.890
But our lamp at home is too dim.


00:35:32.740 --> 00:35:34.690
I was afraid he'd damage his eyesight.


00:35:34.980 --> 00:35:36.680
So I borrowed a lamp.


00:35:37.030 --> 00:35:39.060
The lampshade was made of film.


00:35:40.260 --> 00:35:42.620
He accidentally burned the lampshade.


00:35:44.960 --> 00:35:46.490
Now they want compensation.


00:35:46.650 --> 00:35:48.130
They chase us every day.


00:35:48.710 --> 00:35:50.890
He's afraid to leave the house.


00:35:52.360 --> 00:35:53.690
My poor brother.


00:35:54.870 --> 00:35:56.240
So helpless.


00:36:00.840 --> 00:36:03.200
So what you said on the truck is true?


00:36:19.580 --> 00:36:20.790
What's your name?


00:36:24.890 --> 00:36:26.090
Orphan Liu.


00:36:26.660 --> 00:36:29.090
I know you're Orphan Liu.
I mean your real name.


00:36:29.330 --> 00:36:31.920
It's just Orphan Liu.
My little brother is Little Boy Liu.


00:36:32.030 --> 00:36:33.520
Is that his "real name", too?


00:36:34.890 --> 00:36:36.110
No father, no mother.


00:36:36.160 --> 00:36:38.280
The authorities just
gave us these names.


00:37:01.110 --> 00:37:03.850
Don't cause trouble tonight.
Let me watch the film.


00:37:10.850 --> 00:37:12.520
After that, I'll help you.


00:37:12.960 --> 00:37:14.330
What can you do?


00:37:17.590 --> 00:37:19.240
Hey, what's your name?


00:37:19.290 --> 00:37:21.270
Why are you afraid
of the Security Division?


00:37:30.680 --> 00:37:32.770
Careful, careful.


00:37:35.400 --> 00:37:36.800
Hold on.


00:37:37.830 --> 00:37:39.700
Hold it there...


00:37:41.810 --> 00:37:43.510
Up the steps.


00:37:44.260 --> 00:37:45.550
Good.


00:37:46.710 --> 00:37:48.260
Careful.


00:37:55.960 --> 00:37:57.740
You all follow my instructions.


00:37:59.100 --> 00:38:01.420
Come on.
Turn it over.


00:38:02.500 --> 00:38:03.590
Move.


00:38:03.660 --> 00:38:05.780
Come on.
Easy, easy, easy.


00:38:05.830 --> 00:38:07.170
A little more that way.


00:38:07.550 --> 00:38:09.060
Good. Good. Good.
Stop!


00:38:09.640 --> 00:38:11.530
Let go gently.


00:38:12.260 --> 00:38:13.360
Good.


00:38:13.850 --> 00:38:15.640
Good... good.


00:38:26.550 --> 00:38:28.260
This end mustn't be moved.


00:38:28.510 --> 00:38:29.760
Chopsticks!


00:38:32.010 --> 00:38:33.530
Get chopsticks.


00:38:34.990 --> 00:38:36.300
Follow it from the start,


00:38:37.140 --> 00:38:38.710
and find the other end.


00:38:38.990 --> 00:38:40.670
Whatever you do, don't scratch it.


00:38:40.850 --> 00:38:42.330
Got it?
-Got it.


00:38:43.670 --> 00:38:46.220
Put the screen up,
and keep everyone outside.


00:38:46.420 --> 00:38:47.630
All right.


00:38:52.900 --> 00:38:54.270
What are you clapping for?


00:38:54.340 --> 00:38:56.380
We still haven't found
the start of the reel!


00:39:06.560 --> 00:39:08.110
Here, straighten it.


00:39:35.790 --> 00:39:38.520
Hold the sides, not the middle.


00:39:43.170 --> 00:39:46.310
Remove the dirt.
It's mostly just surface dirt.


00:40:15.970 --> 00:40:17.570
Distilled water. Distilled water.


00:40:18.100 --> 00:40:21.390
The condensation
will create distilled water.


00:40:22.700 --> 00:40:24.220
Don't get it dirty.


00:40:24.540 --> 00:40:26.550
Great. Steam it.


00:40:27.690 --> 00:40:29.740
Careful, careful.
Step aside.


00:40:31.440 --> 00:40:33.580
The distilled water is here!


00:40:36.090 --> 00:40:37.500
Out of the way!


00:40:39.700 --> 00:40:40.800
Behind me,


00:40:41.010 --> 00:40:42.340
careful where you step.


00:40:42.600 --> 00:40:44.140
Don't spill anything.


00:40:46.120 --> 00:40:48.120
Move aside.
Make way up ahead!


00:40:51.520 --> 00:40:53.030
Squeeze the excess water out.


00:40:55.330 --> 00:40:56.740
Then we start to wipe.


00:40:58.600 --> 00:41:00.300
Not too loose, not too tight.


00:41:01.330 --> 00:41:02.710
Wipe downwards.


00:41:03.700 --> 00:41:05.160
One direction only.


00:41:06.800 --> 00:41:08.210
Remember this point.


00:41:08.970 --> 00:41:10.330
Repeat this action.


00:41:14.340 --> 00:41:16.070
Wipe it in sections.


00:41:17.670 --> 00:41:19.550
Got it?
-Got it.


00:41:19.650 --> 00:41:21.560
Good. Let's start.
-All right.


00:41:25.800 --> 00:41:26.800
Hey!


00:41:27.410 --> 00:41:28.970
You're not washing intestines!


00:41:29.080 --> 00:41:30.500
Let me see your fingernails.


00:41:30.880 --> 00:41:33.090
No... No!
Stop, stop, stop, stop!


00:41:33.760 --> 00:41:35.740
Female comrades, stay!
Male comrades, leave!


00:41:35.790 --> 00:41:37.810
Quick, quick, quick!
Children too -all leave!


00:41:38.540 --> 00:41:40.600
Anyone with a fan at home,
bring it back here.


00:41:40.650 --> 00:41:41.960
All right.


00:41:42.010 --> 00:41:44.660
This is delicate work.
Not like separating noodles.


00:41:46.530 --> 00:41:47.980
I...


00:41:48.220 --> 00:41:49.880
...know how to develop photos.


00:41:50.670 --> 00:41:52.470
You?
-Yes.


00:41:53.310 --> 00:41:54.350
Really?


00:41:54.400 --> 00:41:56.120
I can also enlarge prints.


00:41:56.850 --> 00:41:58.270
Wash your hands over there.


00:41:58.530 --> 00:42:00.190
Use soap. Wash twice.


00:42:00.440 --> 00:42:02.430
Wash your face too.


00:42:12.770 --> 00:42:14.690
You really have done this before!


00:42:23.280 --> 00:42:25.060
After it's cleaned, can you screen it?


00:42:25.590 --> 00:42:27.510
As long as it's clean, I can screen it.


00:42:28.840 --> 00:42:30.600
Look, everyone.


00:42:31.020 --> 00:42:33.200
It's hard work to rescue a reel.


00:42:33.840 --> 00:42:36.010
So many people
want to be a projectionist.


00:42:36.680 --> 00:42:38.230
Like that Yang He.


00:42:38.730 --> 00:42:40.930
That bastard
was just a pig feeder,


00:42:41.370 --> 00:42:43.320
using his brother's position


00:42:43.630 --> 00:42:45.100
to try to replace me.


00:42:45.320 --> 00:42:46.380
I won't let him.


00:42:46.430 --> 00:42:48.160
Right, of course not.


00:43:19.110 --> 00:43:20.910
What did I tell you?


00:43:21.200 --> 00:43:23.010
Are you making trouble again?


00:43:23.240 --> 00:43:25.090
How am I making trouble?


00:43:25.230 --> 00:43:27.380
I came to help clean the film.


00:43:29.130 --> 00:43:30.440
Get out of here!


00:43:30.490 --> 00:43:31.920
Why?


00:43:32.090 --> 00:43:33.450
Can't I help?


00:43:49.460 --> 00:43:51.110
You just wait!


00:44:51.190 --> 00:44:52.410
Little brother.


00:44:52.820 --> 00:44:54.290
Sister.


00:44:54.790 --> 00:44:56.820
Where have you been these days?


00:44:57.230 --> 00:44:59.070
Did the neighbour feed you?


00:44:59.460 --> 00:45:01.950
Yes.
She also asked where you went.


00:45:02.160 --> 00:45:04.960
It's got extra hot peppers.
Smell good?


00:45:06.630 --> 00:45:08.740
Eat up!


00:45:32.390 --> 00:45:34.290
Sister, you eat too.


00:45:34.620 --> 00:45:36.540
I've already eaten.


00:45:38.580 --> 00:45:41.330
We'll watch the film later.
"Heroic Sons and Daughters".


00:45:42.100 --> 00:45:43.870
I'm not going.


00:45:44.520 --> 00:45:46.160
All the children are going.


00:45:47.100 --> 00:45:48.650
I'm not going.


00:45:49.800 --> 00:45:51.510
Did they bully you again?


00:45:57.260 --> 00:45:58.770
You should go!


00:45:59.450 --> 00:46:00.830
Why won't you go?


00:46:01.450 --> 00:46:03.140
What are you doing here?


00:46:18.160 --> 00:46:19.700
Little Boy Liu.


00:46:22.390 --> 00:46:25.030
Your sister told me
you burned a lampshade?


00:46:32.220 --> 00:46:33.950
It's all right.


00:46:34.630 --> 00:46:37.610
You can still watch the film.
Don't be scared.


00:46:41.560 --> 00:46:43.430
The bullies are going too, right?


00:46:43.480 --> 00:46:44.870
What are you going to do?


00:46:44.920 --> 00:46:47.060
If they bully you again,
just tell me.


00:46:48.400 --> 00:46:50.020
What can you do?


00:46:52.160 --> 00:46:54.010
Fight them, of course.


00:47:00.990 --> 00:47:03.390
Sister,
who is he?


00:47:04.470 --> 00:47:06.130
A bad element.


00:47:10.480 --> 00:47:13.460
Now...
the film is clean!


00:47:16.370 --> 00:47:17.530
But...


00:47:17.730 --> 00:47:19.290
before the film is dry


00:47:19.610 --> 00:47:21.240
don't move around too much.


00:47:21.290 --> 00:47:23.430
Otherwise, there'll be
too much dust in the air.


00:47:23.480 --> 00:47:26.190
If you have a fan, raise your hand.
-I have two.


00:47:26.530 --> 00:47:28.080
Come up here.


00:47:28.580 --> 00:47:30.940
Stay in order.
Form a queue.


00:47:33.650 --> 00:47:34.910
Be careful, everyone.


00:47:35.020 --> 00:47:36.460
Don't touch the film.


00:47:36.510 --> 00:47:37.920
It's not dry yet.


00:47:38.380 --> 00:47:41.770
Too many people create poor circulation.
The film will dry slowly.


00:47:41.820 --> 00:47:43.920
If you fan it,
it will dry quickly.


00:47:44.170 --> 00:47:45.450
But remember...


00:47:46.390 --> 00:47:47.700
a gentle breeze.


00:47:49.090 --> 00:47:50.460
Very soft.


00:47:50.830 --> 00:47:52.360
Understand?
-Understood.


00:47:52.550 --> 00:47:54.900
Good. Spread out. Let's try.


00:47:57.430 --> 00:47:58.830
Very soft, right?


00:47:59.730 --> 00:48:00.750
Very good.


00:48:00.930 --> 00:48:02.190
What are you doing?


00:48:02.830 --> 00:48:04.360
Think you're the Wind Goddess?


00:48:04.770 --> 00:48:06.970
Fan too hard and it will stick together.


00:48:08.340 --> 00:48:09.950
Just a gentle breeze.


00:48:10.750 --> 00:48:12.360
Very soft.


00:48:17.500 --> 00:48:19.080
Don't use your arm.


00:48:19.650 --> 00:48:21.140
Just your wrist.


00:48:25.480 --> 00:48:26.710
Hey!


00:48:26.900 --> 00:48:28.300
Where did you disappear to?


00:48:29.100 --> 00:48:30.930
You'll need to help me load the film.


00:48:34.090 --> 00:48:35.470
What are you doing?


00:48:35.690 --> 00:48:37.110
Don't touch it.


00:48:37.410 --> 00:48:40.010
The film contains our model citizens.


00:48:40.340 --> 00:48:43.260
Their faces cannot
be smudged by your dirty fingers.


00:48:44.700 --> 00:48:46.180
Carry on.


00:48:49.830 --> 00:48:51.460
Softly, softly.


00:48:52.370 --> 00:48:54.310
That's it. Nice and slow.


00:48:55.950 --> 00:48:57.610
Circulate the air,


00:48:58.140 --> 00:48:59.890
and the film will dry quickly.


00:49:23.150 --> 00:49:24.610
Good, that should do it.


00:49:24.750 --> 00:49:26.230
You can all go back now.


00:49:29.510 --> 00:49:31.240
They're coming back!


00:49:37.500 --> 00:49:39.400
Put these on.


00:49:55.960 --> 00:49:58.220
Careful, don't tangle it.


00:50:06.800 --> 00:50:08.400
It's tangled. It's tangled


00:50:08.720 --> 00:50:10.290
You see, it's tangled.


00:50:10.560 --> 00:50:12.390
Hold it level. Make it flat.


00:50:12.920 --> 00:50:14.550
Hold it level.


00:50:16.110 --> 00:50:17.670
Hold it flat.


00:50:40.290 --> 00:50:42.370
Oh... I forgot, I forgot,
I forgot, I forgot!


00:50:42.420 --> 00:50:44.300
I knew a section was missing.


00:50:44.510 --> 00:50:45.890
I sent them to look for it.


00:50:45.940 --> 00:50:47.820
You had it all along.
Where did you get it?


00:50:47.870 --> 00:50:49.250
Orphan Liu gave it to me.


00:50:49.300 --> 00:50:50.680
Don't lie to me.


00:50:51.320 --> 00:50:53.360
I know a film thief when I see one.


00:50:53.530 --> 00:50:55.670
Making lampshades, fixing bicycles -
-I didn't!


00:50:55.720 --> 00:50:57.580
You're caught!
Let's go to Security.


00:50:57.770 --> 00:50:59.980
She gave it to me.
-Who gave it to you? Yang He?


00:51:00.310 --> 00:51:01.780
Trying to ruin the screening?


00:51:02.420 --> 00:51:04.110
Let's go to Security.
Coming or not?


00:51:04.160 --> 00:51:05.940
If not, I'll tell them myself.


00:51:20.940 --> 00:51:22.390
You just got out of prison?


00:51:22.440 --> 00:51:24.080
I just escaped!


00:51:25.960 --> 00:51:27.120
From a labour camp?


00:51:27.170 --> 00:51:28.940
Yes, escaped from a labour camp.


00:51:29.190 --> 00:51:31.220
Do you know why I risked it?


00:51:33.010 --> 00:51:34.760
To watch your daughter in the film.


00:51:36.600 --> 00:51:38.050
Number 22.


00:51:38.180 --> 00:51:39.880
How long will it play for?


00:51:42.690 --> 00:51:46.060
About 10 minutes.
-I mean when do you send No. 22 back?


00:51:47.370 --> 00:51:49.010
I'll send it back after tonight.


00:51:49.420 --> 00:51:51.020
Then two months later


00:51:51.070 --> 00:51:53.040
we will screen Newsreel No. 23.


00:51:55.350 --> 00:51:56.870
So you understand,


00:51:57.240 --> 00:51:59.100
this is my only chance.


00:51:59.650 --> 00:52:01.520
If I can't watch No. 22,


00:52:01.950 --> 00:52:03.840
I'll slit your throat.


00:52:04.260 --> 00:52:05.760
If you tell anyone,


00:52:06.080 --> 00:52:07.560
I'll slit your throat.


00:52:07.980 --> 00:52:09.880
If you report to the Security Division,


00:52:10.340 --> 00:52:11.970
and I get caught,


00:52:12.360 --> 00:52:13.600
when I'm released,


00:52:13.750 --> 00:52:14.970
I will not spare you.


00:52:15.080 --> 00:52:17.170
And I'll still slit your throat
Understand?


00:52:17.220 --> 00:52:19.090
Yes.
You'll slit my throat.


00:52:19.310 --> 00:52:22.210
I'm not here to slit your throat.
I'm here to watch No. 22!


00:52:23.190 --> 00:52:25.820
I understand.
You're here to watch No. 22.


00:52:44.350 --> 00:52:45.590
Have a seat.


00:52:45.790 --> 00:52:47.600
You sit.


00:52:59.530 --> 00:53:01.960
You'll see your daughter soon.


00:53:09.130 --> 00:53:10.800
How old is she?


00:53:16.570 --> 00:53:18.030
14.


00:53:19.960 --> 00:53:21.780
She was eight when I went in.


00:53:26.180 --> 00:53:27.870
Can I ask you something?


00:53:29.540 --> 00:53:31.510
Why were you sent to a labour camp?


00:53:35.310 --> 00:53:36.830
For fighting.


00:53:38.350 --> 00:53:40.230
I punched a Red Guard.


00:53:41.330 --> 00:53:43.240
You were framed.


00:53:44.270 --> 00:53:45.600
For just one fight...


00:53:45.940 --> 00:53:48.010
Don't you understand politics?


00:53:51.610 --> 00:53:53.790
Your wife and daughter didn't visit?


00:53:57.970 --> 00:53:59.790
My wife divorced me.


00:54:00.640 --> 00:54:02.870
My daughter
didn't want a father like me.


00:54:06.260 --> 00:54:07.730
I can understand.


00:54:08.090 --> 00:54:09.650
It's not just you.


00:54:10.510 --> 00:54:12.120
Don't be so hard on yourself.


00:54:14.390 --> 00:54:15.910
It's tangled. Slow down!


00:54:16.720 --> 00:54:18.770
I... I'm sorry.


00:54:20.720 --> 00:54:22.890
I'll wind it slowly. Nice and slow.


00:54:23.460 --> 00:54:25.150
I was going too fast.


00:54:29.390 --> 00:54:30.830
Is this all right?


00:54:41.200 --> 00:54:42.980
Stop there.


00:54:47.130 --> 00:54:48.690
Let's go.


00:54:50.300 --> 00:54:51.770
Hurry up.


00:54:51.900 --> 00:54:53.150
Hurry up!


00:54:53.230 --> 00:54:54.600
Don't dawdle.


00:54:56.660 --> 00:54:58.720
Faster!
-Come on, faster.


00:55:00.660 --> 00:55:02.030
Hurry up!


00:55:04.150 --> 00:55:05.600
Faster.


00:55:06.090 --> 00:55:07.250
Go in there!


00:55:07.360 --> 00:55:09.360
Go on.
Hurry up.


00:55:13.340 --> 00:55:14.420
So?


00:55:14.470 --> 00:55:16.540
I tried so hard
but didn't get a chance.


00:55:16.670 --> 00:55:18.650
Wait a little longer.
-Wait for what?


00:55:18.700 --> 00:55:20.210
The film will be gone tomorrow.


00:55:20.260 --> 00:55:23.750
Your little brother is really clumsy.
I'm losing sleep over my lampshade.


00:55:23.910 --> 00:55:26.160
If I could buy one
we wouldn't be here.


00:55:26.240 --> 00:55:27.880
Please, I'll think of something.


00:55:27.930 --> 00:55:30.080
Think of something?
How long do you need to think?


00:55:30.130 --> 00:55:31.690
When do we get the lampshade?


00:55:31.870 --> 00:55:33.440
Tell me when!


00:55:33.540 --> 00:55:36.230
We'll hit you every time we see you.


00:55:39.830 --> 00:55:41.420
I'll turn on the projector.


00:55:43.100 --> 00:55:46.630
When it's finished,
wind up the film and bring it to me.


00:55:47.570 --> 00:55:48.910
I'll be just over there.


00:55:48.960 --> 00:55:50.890
And don't forget to turn off the light.


00:55:51.560 --> 00:55:52.900
Thank you.


00:56:00.630 --> 00:56:03.510
The rescue mission
was a success!


00:56:06.750 --> 00:56:09.180
We can screen the film!


00:56:53.760 --> 00:56:55.450
Turn off the lights.


00:56:55.500 --> 00:56:58.430
Turn off the lights!


00:58:03.950 --> 00:58:05.380
Hold this.


00:58:18.810 --> 00:58:20.110
What do you want?


00:58:20.450 --> 00:58:22.140
Who the hell are you?


00:58:29.570 --> 00:58:31.580
Do you know Little Boy Liu?
-Yes.


00:58:31.630 --> 00:58:33.670
He's under my protection.
You can't touch him.


00:58:33.720 --> 00:58:35.960
Come with me.
-I'm not going anywhere.


00:58:36.840 --> 00:58:38.440
Who are you?
-I'm not going.


00:58:38.760 --> 00:58:40.180
What the hell?


00:58:59.730 --> 00:59:01.570
What's going on down there?


00:59:02.130 --> 00:59:04.160
Are we watching a film
or having a fight?


00:59:05.220 --> 00:59:07.260
What's more important?


00:59:09.080 --> 00:59:10.810
The film teaches us to be better.


00:59:10.860 --> 00:59:12.360
You should learn from it.


00:59:12.560 --> 00:59:14.660
Comrades of the 2nd Unit,


00:59:14.730 --> 00:59:16.240
separate them!


00:59:24.330 --> 00:59:25.670
Let me go!


01:00:01.820 --> 01:00:03.190
Where's the Newsreel?


01:00:03.310 --> 01:00:05.080
Aren't we going to watch your daughter?


01:00:05.130 --> 01:00:06.970
Why are you getting all worked up?


01:00:35.990 --> 01:00:38.280
Everyone, I have an announcement.


01:00:39.090 --> 01:00:41.280
It's getting late,


01:00:42.100 --> 01:00:44.230
so we'll just go straight
to the main feature


01:00:44.280 --> 01:00:45.710
"Heroic Sons and Daughters".


01:00:45.760 --> 01:00:46.970
How does that sound?


01:00:47.020 --> 01:00:49.140
Great!


01:00:54.600 --> 01:00:57.460
CHANGCHUN FILM STUDIOS


01:01:00.070 --> 01:01:02.860
HEROIC SONS AND DAUGHTERS


01:01:03.290 --> 01:01:06.240
based on the novel
"Reunion" by Ba Jin


01:01:36.630 --> 01:01:38.020
Don't. You can't lift it


01:01:38.070 --> 01:01:39.930
Can't lift it?
Give me some space.


01:01:42.760 --> 01:01:44.620
You're blocking the view. Move over.


01:01:45.090 --> 01:01:46.370
Move!


01:01:47.860 --> 01:01:49.670
What are you doing?
Get out of the way!


01:01:49.720 --> 01:01:51.820
Quickly!
Or I'll beat you!


01:02:39.720 --> 01:02:40.900
Where's your sister?


01:02:41.040 --> 01:02:42.400
I don't know.


01:02:42.900 --> 01:02:44.590
You don't know where your sister is?


01:02:45.880 --> 01:02:47.460
I don't know.


01:02:49.760 --> 01:02:51.430
Where did your sister hide the can?


01:02:52.250 --> 01:02:53.920
The can, did you see it?


01:02:54.990 --> 01:02:56.760
Did she hide it here?


01:02:57.300 --> 01:02:58.790
Is it here?


01:03:21.220 --> 01:03:23.270
Did she come back?


01:03:25.990 --> 01:03:27.540
You are a bad element!


01:03:27.590 --> 01:03:29.260
Tell me where she -


01:03:31.570 --> 01:03:33.960
You're a bad element.


01:03:35.040 --> 01:03:37.620
You're a bad element.


01:04:06.790 --> 01:04:07.920
For victory!


01:04:08.440 --> 01:04:10.660
Fire at me!


01:04:35.290 --> 01:04:36.690
Dear Leading Cadre,


01:04:36.860 --> 01:04:37.880
Comrades,


01:04:38.130 --> 01:04:39.340
Commissar Wang,


01:04:39.740 --> 01:04:42.500
victory will always belong to us!


01:05:02.250 --> 01:05:04.960
It's burned!


01:05:05.290 --> 01:05:06.610
The film is burning.


01:05:12.930 --> 01:05:14.470
Shut the door!


01:05:29.450 --> 01:05:30.830
Oh, and -


01:05:32.630 --> 01:05:34.130
don't leave after the film.


01:05:36.450 --> 01:05:37.810
Just wait here.


01:05:38.050 --> 01:05:39.510
Wait for what?
Wait for who?


01:05:39.560 --> 01:05:40.940
Wait until I find the reel.


01:05:40.990 --> 01:05:43.130
As soon as I find it
you'll screen it.


01:05:43.180 --> 01:05:44.470
You got it?


01:05:44.630 --> 01:05:46.740
What reel?
-No. 22!


01:05:47.020 --> 01:05:48.930
Isn't that No. 22?


01:05:49.420 --> 01:05:51.040
There, on the table?


01:05:56.560 --> 01:05:58.690
Didn't you send it over with Orphan Liu?


01:06:08.360 --> 01:06:09.580
Where is she?


01:06:09.630 --> 01:06:11.090
She went to watch the film.


01:06:12.060 --> 01:06:13.630
What did she say?


01:06:14.230 --> 01:06:16.480
She said the lampshade looks pretty.


01:06:21.330 --> 01:06:23.860
Isn't this lampshade made of film?


01:06:24.090 --> 01:06:25.890
That's right. It's very fashionable now.


01:06:25.990 --> 01:06:27.620
Not even 12.5 metres' worth.


01:06:27.800 --> 01:06:29.820
Mine is more.
More than 20 metres.


01:06:29.990 --> 01:06:32.020
And colour too.
Technicolor.


01:06:32.140 --> 01:06:33.850
Better than anyone else's.


01:06:39.710 --> 01:06:41.340
When are you coming back?


01:06:41.490 --> 01:06:46.790
Raging flames roar into an ode


01:06:48.390 --> 01:06:55.060
Heard by the world to heroes, to heroes


01:06:55.290 --> 01:06:58.660
The thunder of guns rattles


01:06:58.790 --> 01:07:02.420
Rough waves thrust high and echo


01:07:02.560 --> 01:07:09.000
Fight for people, against our foes


01:07:09.340 --> 01:07:16.230
Give your life for peace for all


01:07:18.590 --> 01:07:25.620
Crimsoned by the blood of heroes


01:07:25.930 --> 01:07:30.920
Banners in sunlight brightly glow


01:07:31.930 --> 01:07:37.260
Nourished by their lives below


01:07:37.860 --> 01:07:48.310
Spring flowers everywhere grow


01:08:13.210 --> 01:08:14.780
Why aren't you watching the film?


01:08:14.980 --> 01:08:16.900
I've seen it many times.


01:08:24.470 --> 01:08:26.380
This song is really good.


01:08:31.950 --> 01:08:33.750
I've been looking everywhere for you.


01:08:33.800 --> 01:08:35.360
What for?


01:08:36.470 --> 01:08:37.500
I thought...


01:08:37.600 --> 01:08:39.070
You were great, back there.


01:08:39.910 --> 01:08:41.580
Everybody is afraid of you.


01:08:43.320 --> 01:08:45.800
That lot in the 2nd Unit
only look out for themselves.


01:08:46.910 --> 01:08:49.530
The next time I see those thugs
I'm going to kill them.


01:08:49.690 --> 01:08:51.510
There is no "next time".


01:09:09.770 --> 01:09:11.570
You haven't been home yet?


01:09:57.410 --> 01:09:59.660
THE END
made in 1964


01:10:49.660 --> 01:10:52.120
SINCERELY SERVING THE PEOPLE
Hebei province


01:10:52.270 --> 01:10:54.360
The whole staff of the
Eastern Road grain store


01:10:54.410 --> 01:10:56.400
always remember
the spirit of Chairman Mao.


01:10:56.730 --> 01:10:58.620
Under the guidance of "Serve the People"


01:10:58.790 --> 01:11:01.520
they study the advanced work
of the 19th Grain Store


01:11:01.730 --> 01:11:03.320
and implement the spirit


01:11:03.390 --> 01:11:05.530
of "Serve the People" in their work.


01:11:07.190 --> 01:11:08.950
They don't fear hardship,


01:11:09.000 --> 01:11:10.500
and they don't fear death.


01:11:11.460 --> 01:11:13.660
Party members take the lead


01:11:14.030 --> 01:11:15.120
to educate


01:11:15.230 --> 01:11:17.760
the young students who come to train.


01:11:18.930 --> 01:11:21.900
Everyone in the store


01:11:21.950 --> 01:11:24.120
strives to do the best work.


01:11:31.290 --> 01:11:33.190
Shenyang Heavy Machinery Factory


01:11:33.310 --> 01:11:36.540
develops its mass movement
for industrial production.


01:11:36.620 --> 01:11:38.820
While adhering to socialism


01:11:39.030 --> 01:11:41.170
they strive for greatness.


01:11:41.340 --> 01:11:43.900
Their revolutionary production
is booming.


01:11:54.160 --> 01:11:57.260
The Guangxi Zhuang Autonomous Region
is rich in sugarcane.


01:11:57.530 --> 01:11:59.620
It is a national base
for sugar production.


01:12:00.130 --> 01:12:03.740
In recent years sugar production
has developed significantly.


01:12:20.540 --> 01:12:22.010
Did you see your daughter?


01:12:24.990 --> 01:12:27.060
She's in there, right?


01:12:27.580 --> 01:12:28.960
Can you screen it again?


01:12:29.010 --> 01:12:30.360
Wait a bit.


01:12:31.280 --> 01:12:33.210
If I screen it now
they'll never leave.


01:12:33.430 --> 01:12:35.260
They'll watch anything,
that lot.


01:12:35.760 --> 01:12:37.880
They'll watch all damn night.


01:12:51.350 --> 01:12:53.380
After they've all gone


01:12:54.060 --> 01:12:55.420
please don't hurt me.


01:12:55.730 --> 01:12:57.350
Why would I hurt you?


01:12:59.980 --> 01:13:01.570
I'll leave after I've watched it.


01:13:02.270 --> 01:13:03.640
Thank you.


01:13:05.840 --> 01:13:07.290
You drink tea?


01:13:07.710 --> 01:13:09.040
Have some tea.


01:13:09.240 --> 01:13:10.640
It's Gao Mo tea.


01:13:19.260 --> 01:13:20.740
The next reel is a mess.


01:13:20.880 --> 01:13:23.070
Sound and image are scratched up.


01:13:23.790 --> 01:13:25.450
Dragged behind a cart


01:13:25.760 --> 01:13:27.170
for miles and miles.


01:13:27.790 --> 01:13:29.730
Your son...


01:13:33.140 --> 01:13:34.600
...doesn't have your sense.


01:13:39.420 --> 01:13:40.970
Do you know...


01:13:41.760 --> 01:13:43.790
why I don't have cleaning fluid?


01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:45.390
Go on.


01:13:48.930 --> 01:13:51.980
When my son was four,
and didn't know what he was doing,


01:13:52.480 --> 01:13:54.820
he drank the cleaning fluid.


01:13:56.870 --> 01:13:59.730
He was vomiting, and had diarrhoea
and a high temperature.


01:14:01.120 --> 01:14:03.400
I didn't take it seriously,


01:14:05.780 --> 01:14:07.720
but it gave him brain damage.


01:14:12.340 --> 01:14:14.530
He can only drive a cart now.


01:14:38.730 --> 01:14:40.880
The whole staff of the
Eastern Road Grain Store


01:14:41.030 --> 01:14:42.980
always remember
the spirit of Chairman Mao.


01:14:43.030 --> 01:14:44.950
Under the guidance of "Serve the People"


01:14:45.680 --> 01:14:47.490
they don't fear hardship,


01:14:47.630 --> 01:14:49.320
and they don't fear death.


01:14:49.960 --> 01:14:52.260
Party members take the lead


01:14:52.630 --> 01:14:53.890
to educate


01:14:53.990 --> 01:14:56.290
the young students who come to train.


01:14:57.460 --> 01:15:00.470
Everyone in the store


01:15:00.520 --> 01:15:02.580
strives to do the best work.


01:15:13.880 --> 01:15:16.600
Is it the part about
studying the 19th Grain Store?


01:15:17.980 --> 01:15:19.750
The youngest student there.


01:15:21.990 --> 01:15:23.590
It's only about a second.


01:15:24.710 --> 01:15:26.040
Is she the young girl


01:15:26.270 --> 01:15:28.340
who's carrying the big sack of flour?


01:15:47.450 --> 01:15:49.430
Striving for what?


01:15:51.220 --> 01:15:52.970
She's only 14.


01:15:54.950 --> 01:15:57.290
Why does she
have to compete with adults?


01:16:00.210 --> 01:16:01.740
She must do her best.


01:16:01.890 --> 01:16:03.690
As long as she does her best


01:16:04.560 --> 01:16:06.340
she will gain merit.


01:16:06.690 --> 01:16:09.520
That's the only way she can be free
from your political influence.


01:16:26.950 --> 01:16:28.780
You've seen your daughter.


01:16:29.470 --> 01:16:31.190
Don't you need to leave now?


01:16:44.970 --> 01:16:46.720
I don't want to leave.


01:16:48.230 --> 01:16:50.380
You can't spend the night here.


01:16:51.000 --> 01:16:52.760
Please screen it again.


01:16:54.960 --> 01:16:57.270
One second is too short.
It's not enough.


01:16:58.240 --> 01:16:59.670
If I screen it again


01:16:59.960 --> 01:17:01.690
it's still only a second.


01:17:01.770 --> 01:17:03.500
Then screen it 10 times.


01:17:04.180 --> 01:17:05.610
10 times?


01:17:07.020 --> 01:17:09.120
That's still only 10 seconds.


01:17:09.440 --> 01:17:11.170
If we keep reloading the film


01:17:11.690 --> 01:17:13.380
it will take all night.


01:17:13.470 --> 01:17:15.270
The sun will come up.


01:17:23.220 --> 01:17:24.920
I'll screen it for you 100 times.


01:17:26.290 --> 01:17:27.880
I'll make a loop.


01:17:31.120 --> 01:17:32.720
Watch it to your heart's content.


01:18:15.530 --> 01:18:17.070
This is called a loop.


01:18:17.750 --> 01:18:19.450
Among all four Units


01:18:20.000 --> 01:18:21.700
no one else can do this.


01:18:23.910 --> 01:18:25.800
Careful...
Don't block the circuit.


01:18:31.170 --> 01:18:33.310
Under, under.
Go under.


01:18:37.730 --> 01:18:38.820
All right.


01:18:39.150 --> 01:18:40.980
Now it's ready.


01:18:50.880 --> 01:18:52.190
Old fellow,


01:18:52.650 --> 01:18:54.100
go down and watch.


01:18:54.250 --> 01:18:56.020
It looks better from down there.


01:18:56.160 --> 01:18:57.480
As long as there is power


01:18:57.570 --> 01:18:59.400
you can watch it as long as you want.


01:19:17.830 --> 01:19:20.000
The whole staff of the
Eastern Road Grain Store


01:19:20.240 --> 01:19:22.260
always remember
the spirit of Chairman Mao.


01:19:22.310 --> 01:19:24.270
Under the guidance of "Serve the People"


01:19:24.630 --> 01:19:27.220
they study the advanced work
of the 19th Grain Store,


01:19:28.790 --> 01:19:30.420
and implement the spirit


01:19:30.660 --> 01:19:32.920
of "Serve the People" in their work.


01:19:34.860 --> 01:19:36.480
They don't fear hardship,


01:19:36.630 --> 01:19:38.370
and they don't fear death.


01:19:39.090 --> 01:19:41.320
Party members take the lead


01:19:41.590 --> 01:19:42.620
to educate


01:19:42.960 --> 01:19:45.360
the young students who come to train.


01:19:46.540 --> 01:19:49.480
Everyone in the store strives -


01:20:05.490 --> 01:20:07.590
The whole staff of
the Eastern Road Grain Store


01:20:07.640 --> 01:20:09.620
always remember
the spirit of Chairman Mao.


01:20:09.670 --> 01:20:11.690
Under the guidance of "Serve the People"


01:20:11.880 --> 01:20:14.920
they study the advanced work
of the 19th Grain Store,


01:20:15.250 --> 01:20:16.860
and implement the spirit


01:20:16.990 --> 01:20:19.620
of "Serve the People" in their work.


01:20:20.290 --> 01:20:22.190
They don't fear hardship,


01:20:22.290 --> 01:20:23.960
and they don't fear death.


01:20:24.890 --> 01:20:26.990
Party members take the lead


01:20:27.190 --> 01:20:28.220
to educate


01:20:28.430 --> 01:20:31.000
the young students who come to train.


01:20:31.830 --> 01:20:34.800
Everyone in the store strives -


01:21:09.330 --> 01:21:11.060
and implement the spirit


01:21:11.150 --> 01:21:13.480
of "Serve the People" in their work.


01:21:15.340 --> 01:21:17.110
They don't fear hardship,


01:21:17.190 --> 01:21:19.120
and they don't fear death.


01:21:26.310 --> 01:21:27.710
Officer Cui.


01:21:27.970 --> 01:21:29.980
Security Division, Officer Cui.


01:21:32.800 --> 01:21:35.940
What took you so long?
I telephoned you many times.


01:21:36.110 --> 01:21:38.760
I couldn't come earlier.
So many people were watching the film.


01:21:38.810 --> 01:21:41.590
He has a weapon.
What if he went crazy and hurt someone?


01:21:41.640 --> 01:21:43.780
You're right.
-Where is he?


01:21:43.890 --> 01:21:46.920
Per your instructions, I've kept
him inside, watching the film.


01:21:47.540 --> 01:21:49.200
Does he still have the knife?
-Yes.


01:21:49.250 --> 01:21:51.940
Ah, that reminds me, you should
all know, he has a nasty temper,


01:21:51.990 --> 01:21:54.010
and loves to fight.
Be careful!


01:21:54.060 --> 01:21:55.410
We're not scared of him!


01:21:57.280 --> 01:21:58.590
Officer Cui,


01:21:59.090 --> 01:22:00.740
did I do a great deed?


01:22:01.510 --> 01:22:02.680
Of course!


01:22:02.810 --> 01:22:05.210
Then please tell our leader


01:22:05.460 --> 01:22:07.100
that there's no one capable


01:22:07.410 --> 01:22:09.310
of replacing me as projectionist.


01:22:09.840 --> 01:22:12.210
Party members take the lead


01:22:12.560 --> 01:22:14.120
to educate


01:22:14.190 --> 01:22:16.520
the young students who come to train.


01:22:16.880 --> 01:22:20.020
Everyone in the store strives -


01:22:35.910 --> 01:22:38.220
Why did you go to my home?


01:22:39.570 --> 01:22:41.720
It was a mistake.
I'm sorry.


01:22:41.770 --> 01:22:43.000
A mistake?


01:22:43.260 --> 01:22:45.310
What's this you're watching?
Isn't it No. 22?


01:22:45.360 --> 01:22:46.630
Didn't I bring it over?


01:22:46.700 --> 01:22:47.790
You...


01:22:47.840 --> 01:22:49.900
Please -move your head.
Let's discuss it later.


01:22:49.950 --> 01:22:52.870
Let me finish watching my daughter.
-You only care about your daughter.


01:22:52.990 --> 01:22:55.730
What did you do to my little brother?
He's still crying at home.


01:22:56.490 --> 01:22:58.580
I'll apologise
to both of you, all right?


01:22:58.650 --> 01:22:59.850
Not all right!


01:22:59.980 --> 01:23:01.230
Then what do you want?


01:23:01.280 --> 01:23:02.840
Go and talk to my little brother.


01:23:02.890 --> 01:23:04.300
Tell him that you wronged me,


01:23:04.350 --> 01:23:05.930
that you are a bad element,


01:23:06.320 --> 01:23:08.080
you won't scare him again,


01:23:08.130 --> 01:23:10.050
and the Security Division
is taking you away.


01:23:10.100 --> 01:23:11.150
Fine!


01:23:11.200 --> 01:23:14.070
But let me finish watching my daughter,
then I'll go.


01:23:14.310 --> 01:23:16.830
When I get to your home
I'll apologise to both of you.


01:23:17.080 --> 01:23:18.120
All right?


01:23:18.170 --> 01:23:19.670
Which one is your daughter?


01:23:20.750 --> 01:23:22.040
She's coming up.


01:23:22.090 --> 01:23:23.690
The one carrying the flour bag.


01:23:23.740 --> 01:23:25.140
Move over.
You -


01:23:25.360 --> 01:23:27.720
She's just coming up.
-Your daughter isn't in this!


01:23:27.910 --> 01:23:31.010
Why would I lie to you?
She's coming on right now.


01:23:31.830 --> 01:23:33.650
Look!


01:23:37.610 --> 01:23:38.810
That's her?
-Yes.


01:23:38.860 --> 01:23:40.100
Your daughter?
-Yes.


01:23:40.150 --> 01:23:42.040
Carrying that bag didn't kill her?


01:23:45.840 --> 01:23:47.460
How dare you!


01:23:53.970 --> 01:23:55.430
Are you hurt?


01:23:55.480 --> 01:23:56.720
Get off!


01:23:56.770 --> 01:23:58.390
Get up first.
-Don't touch me.


01:23:58.440 --> 01:23:59.770
Come on, I'll help you up.


01:23:59.820 --> 01:24:01.480
You kicked me.
-Sit, sit, sit.


01:24:01.530 --> 01:24:03.870
Back off!
-Take it easy... huh?


01:24:04.890 --> 01:24:06.810
You -
-You can't leave today.


01:24:08.560 --> 01:24:10.860
I'll get you.
I won't spare you.


01:24:11.570 --> 01:24:14.090
You made a mess at my place,
bullied my brother.


01:24:14.380 --> 01:24:15.990
Is that fair?


01:24:17.780 --> 01:24:19.840
Don't run!
I'll get you.


01:24:24.180 --> 01:24:25.720
That's him!
Grab him.


01:24:25.980 --> 01:24:27.130
What the hell?


01:24:27.420 --> 01:24:28.890
Why are you hitting me?


01:24:32.160 --> 01:24:33.310
Don't run!


01:24:33.360 --> 01:24:35.130
Block him.
Quickly!


01:25:09.320 --> 01:25:12.650
You've got the wrong person!
I'm the one you want. Come after me!


01:25:13.730 --> 01:25:16.330
It's him.
Go! Get him!


01:25:48.260 --> 01:25:49.860
Go! Get the rope!


01:25:49.910 --> 01:25:50.960
Tie them up.


01:25:51.010 --> 01:25:52.340
Didn't you hear me?


01:25:52.680 --> 01:25:53.760
Quick!


01:25:53.980 --> 01:25:55.500
Hurry up, idiots!


01:26:07.190 --> 01:26:08.790
Mr. Fan, start!


01:26:08.880 --> 01:26:10.140
Right.


01:26:45.380 --> 01:26:48.090
Father, are you all right now?


01:26:48.400 --> 01:26:50.070
Yes, I'm all right.


01:26:50.380 --> 01:26:52.390
Are mother and little brother
all right too?


01:26:52.440 --> 01:26:54.220
They're both fine too.


01:26:54.480 --> 01:26:56.170
Take a look at this.


01:26:59.770 --> 01:27:00.840
Little brother!


01:27:00.900 --> 01:27:03.060
He is a model worker.


01:27:03.120 --> 01:27:05.650
Reporting, leader.
I'm recovered and back to work.


01:27:05.850 --> 01:27:08.130
Fully recovered?
-Yes, fully.


01:27:08.310 --> 01:27:11.290
Ah Fang, do you know him?


01:27:11.670 --> 01:27:13.830
He's our Commissar Wang.
Of course I know him.


01:27:14.860 --> 01:27:17.770
He's Wang Dong,
your real father.


01:27:29.950 --> 01:27:32.560
Wang Fang,
it's true.


01:27:35.200 --> 01:27:39.380
You forgot. I often said I wanted to
get more information about Wang Dong.


01:27:40.060 --> 01:27:42.550
Wang Fubiao brought her up.


01:27:42.600 --> 01:27:46.400
But Wang Dong is her real father.


01:27:46.860 --> 01:27:48.890
Do you understand now?


01:28:00.620 --> 01:28:01.890
Father.


01:28:06.800 --> 01:28:08.200
To be honest,


01:28:08.430 --> 01:28:09.930
I miss my father a lot.


01:28:10.030 --> 01:28:11.690
This is a great thing, Ah Fang.


01:28:11.770 --> 01:28:15.950
You have a worker father
and a revolutionary father.


01:28:16.400 --> 01:28:19.730
Yes. You should be like your brother.


01:28:19.810 --> 01:28:24.190
Be a good daughter of the working class,
and keep the revolution going.


01:28:34.310 --> 01:28:36.470
Did you contact the labour camp?
-Yes.


01:28:36.910 --> 01:28:38.310
Were they surprised?


01:28:38.590 --> 01:28:41.550
That lot... they only
searched the train and bus stations.


01:28:42.180 --> 01:28:43.370
What did they say?


01:28:43.470 --> 01:28:45.470
They've sent a car over.


01:28:47.990 --> 01:28:49.350
Have some soup.


01:28:49.920 --> 01:28:52.740
Just put it here.
We'll help ourselves. Thanks.


01:28:57.150 --> 01:28:58.790
We caught him,


01:28:59.110 --> 01:29:01.010
and we are sending him back.


01:29:01.200 --> 01:29:04.690
Shouldn't the labour camp
treat us to a good meal?


01:29:05.120 --> 01:29:06.350
Of course!


01:29:30.350 --> 01:29:32.490
I didn't know they would beat you.


01:29:41.800 --> 01:29:43.450
Something for you.


01:29:45.680 --> 01:29:47.020
Mr. Fan,


01:29:48.410 --> 01:29:49.920
Thank you.


01:29:51.720 --> 01:29:52.830
Wait.


01:29:54.400 --> 01:29:55.910
I have a request.


01:30:31.490 --> 01:30:33.270
Keep moving!


01:30:41.870 --> 01:30:44.100
What are you looking at?
Keep moving!


01:31:17.900 --> 01:31:20.710
What did Mr. Fan put in your pocket?


01:31:21.090 --> 01:31:22.090
Huh?


01:31:22.420 --> 01:31:23.580
Left pocket.


01:31:24.370 --> 01:31:26.790
Don't move!
-Stay still!


01:31:36.790 --> 01:31:38.120
What the hell is this?


01:31:40.350 --> 01:31:41.550
My daughter.


01:31:41.750 --> 01:31:42.890
That's my daughter.


01:31:43.190 --> 01:31:44.720
What daughter?


01:31:44.770 --> 01:31:46.230
Give it back!


01:31:47.490 --> 01:31:48.820
Give it back!
-Go!


01:31:48.870 --> 01:31:50.170
Give it to me!


01:31:50.220 --> 01:31:51.230
Go, go go.


01:31:51.280 --> 01:31:52.830
Give it to me!


01:31:56.100 --> 01:31:58.040
Give it back!


01:31:58.090 --> 01:32:00.790
Shut up. Behave.
Keep moving!


01:32:32.270 --> 01:32:33.560
Keep going!


01:33:48.800 --> 01:33:50.680
Keep moving!


01:35:17.560 --> 01:35:19.630
I hear you're not leaving
for another two days.


01:35:19.680 --> 01:35:21.170
Yes, I have something to do.


01:35:21.640 --> 01:35:22.830
What could that be?


01:35:22.880 --> 01:35:24.110
Everything is fine now.


01:35:24.160 --> 01:35:25.930
We've expedited the new policy for you.


01:35:25.980 --> 01:35:27.170
Times have changed.


01:35:27.220 --> 01:35:29.050
Hurry home and enjoy your life.


01:35:29.690 --> 01:35:31.390
Of course I'll go home.


01:35:56.670 --> 01:36:00.580
SUCCESSFULLY RECRUITING STUDENTS
IS THE HOPE OF THE PEOPLE


01:38:31.050 --> 01:38:32.800
This was the place.


01:43:23.960 --> 01:43:26.850
One second is too short.
It's not enough.

